      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi kala ana miaka mirongo miiri ariphoandza kutawala, naye watawala miaka kumi na sita ko Jerusalemu. Kayahenda garigo sawa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, dza arivyohenda mkarewe Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walunga mifano ya afalume a Iziraeli na achitengeza vizuka vya chuma cha kuyayuswa vya mabaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha wafukiza uvumba kpwenye dete ra mwana wa Hinomu na achiocha anae a chilume dza sadaka ya kuochwa, sawa na mahendo ga kutsukiza ga mataifa ganjina ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu wagazola mbere za atu a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi walavya sadaka, na kufukiza uvumba mo mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kulavira sadaka, na tsini ya chila muhi mkpwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
