            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Mwenyezi Mlungu achimtiya mfalume Ahazi mkpwononi mwa mfalume wa Shamu ambaye wamturya na achihala mateka atue anji sana achiaphirika Damasikasi. Piya watiywa mkpwononi mwa mfalume wa Iziraeli na achipigbwa vibaya, atue anji achiolagbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Peka mwana wa Remaliya, kpwa siku mwenga tu, waolaga atu masujaa elufu gana mwenga na mirongo miiri a jeshi ra Juda. Ahendwa hivyo kpwa kukala aricha kulunga Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akare ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Zikiri, mutu hodari kula Efuraimu achiolaga Maaseya mwana wa mfalume, na Azirikamu ambaye kala ni mkpwulu wa arindzi a nyumba ya mfalume, na Elikana ambaye kala ni wa phiri chimamlaka kula mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo atu a Iziraeli achihala ndugu zao mateka, achetu, ana alume na ana achetu, atu elufu magana mairi. Piya ahala zewe nyinji kula hiko achiphiya nazo kpwao Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Odedi nabii wa Mwenyezi Mlungu kala asagala hiko. Iye watuluka ili akutane na hiro jeshi ririrokpwedza Samariya, achiriambira, “Hebu lolani! Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akare enu kala akatsukizwa ni atu a Juda ndio mana achiatiya mwenu mikononi, ela mwino mkaaolaga kpwa ukatili hadi Mlungu akasononeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na vino mnalonda kuatawala atu a Juda na Jerusalemu, alume kpwa achetu akale atumwa enu. Vino hino siyo dambi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya phahi niphundzani. Uyizani hinya atu muchioahala mateka, kpwa mana ni ndugu zenu. Musiphohenda hivyo, mundamtsukiza Mwenyezi Mlungu akutiyeni adabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho, vilongozi a ne kula mbari ya Efuraimu ambao kala ni Azaria mwana wa Jehohanani, Berekiya mwana wa Meshilemothi, Jehizikiya mwana wa Shalumu na Amasa mwana wa Hadilai, aunuka na achimuunga mkpwono Odedi kukala majeshi ga Iziraeli gakakosera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achiamba, “Hinyo mchioahala mateka msiarehe hipha kpwa mana mundakala munauenjerezera hatiya mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuenjereza zo dambi zehu na makosa gehu. Go makosa gehu ni makulu kare na tsukizize kali zi chinyume cha Iziraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho hinyo anajeshi achiarichira mateka phamwenga na zewe zosi zirizohalwa kula Juda mbere za vilongozi na mkpwutano wosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hinyo vilongozi a ne achihala seemu ya nguwo zirizohalwa zewe achiavwika hara ambao kala achitsaha kahi za hinyo mateka. Achiapha virahu, chakurya, vinwadzi na achiapaka mafuha ariokala na vironda. Hara ariokala akaphunguka mkpwotse achitsukulwa dzulu ya punda achiuyizwa kpwa ndugu zao hiko Jeriko. Ndipho hinyo vilongozi achiuya Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku zizo, mfalume Ahazi wa Juda wahuma ajumbe kpwa mfalume wa Ashuru ili edze amterye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana hinyo atu a Edomu kala akavamia Juda tsona na achihala atu mateka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afilisti nao ainjira midzi ya tsi ya kugbwa kanda-kanda ya myango ya Juda, na iriyo jangbwa ririro uphande wa mwakani mwa myango ya Juda, achihala na Bethi-Shemeshi, Aijaloni, Gederothi, Soko phamwenga na malaloge, Timuna phamwenga na malaloge, Gimuzo phamwenga na malaloge, nao achitsamira himo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana Mwenyezi Mlungu kala akaatiya adabu atu a Juda kpwa sababu ya mfalume Ahazi wa Iziraeli waahenda ahende dambi, naye achikosa kukala muaminifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho mfalume Tiligathi-Pilineseri wa Ashuru ariphotsoloka kayamterya mfalume Ahazi bii, ela wamgandamiza hadi mikono ichirejera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi wahala vitu vya samani kula nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, nyumba ya mfalume, nyumba za akulue, achivilavya dza zawadi kpwa mfalume wa Ashuru, ela taviyamterya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata wakati ariphokala mashakani, mfalume Ahazi waenderera kusakala muaminifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo milungu ya Damasikasi iriyomʼbwaga ye wailavira sadaka achiamba, “Kpwa kukala milungu ya afalume a Shamu ikaaterya kuniturya, nami nailavira sadaka ili initerye.” Ela gago ndigo garigomrehera maangamizi iye phamwenga na Iziraeli yosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
