              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Ahazi wakusanya miyo yosi ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, achiivundza-vundza. Miryango ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu achiifunga ili kusiinjire mutu na achitengeza mwatu mwa kulavira sadaka vizuka kpwenye chila pembe ya Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waika mwatu mwa dzulu mwa ibada kpwa ajili ya milungu yanjina kpwenye chila mudzi hiko Juda achiilavira sadaka. Na kpwa kuhenda hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akaree wamtsukirirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
