        {
          "text": "Ahazi wafwa, na atu achimzika kpwenye nyo mudzi, yani Jerusalemu, mana taamuzikire kpwenye vikura vya afalume a Iziraeli. Mwanawe Hezekiya achikala mfalume badalaye.",
